  "dct_title_s": "Wabash County Aerial Photography: Illinois, 1938",
  "dct_description_sm": [
    "See Related Records below to download individual sheets as GeoTIFFs. Statewide aerial photographs were first acquired for Illinois from 1937 through 1947. The original silver nitrate film negatives were destroyed in the early 1980s due to deterioration, so the photographic paper prints scanned for this collection are now the best substitute for them. This record covers Wabash County, photographed in 1938."
